              "ghCSGRgVB_o@2787",
              "mk-6cFebjis@4508",
              "mk-6cFebjis@4511",
              "mk-6cFebjis@4513",
              "mk-6cFebjis@4515"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch02.s12.p06.04",
            "text": "In another small example, if the vocabulary size is 4 and the embedding dimension is 5, the embedding matrix has 4 rows and 5 columns, and each token ID gets a five-dimensional vector.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "ghCSGRgVB_o@2937",
              "ghCSGRgVB_o@2939",
              "ghCSGRgVB_o@2952",
              "ghCSGRgVB_o@2954",
              "ghCSGRgVB_o@2956",
              "ghCSGRgVB_o@2960",
              "ghCSGRgVB_o@2963",
